{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"matchingSemantics","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"semanticLevel","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegexSemanticLevel","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RegexSemanticLevel","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing18RegexSemanticLevelV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Regex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Regex","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegexOutput","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV0C6Outputa"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"semanticLevel","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The semantics to use during matching."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The modified regular expression.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When matching with grapheme cluster semantics (the default),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"metacharacters like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"."},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\w"},{"text":", custom character classes, and character","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"class instances like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".any"},{"text":" match a grapheme cluster when possible,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"corresponding with the default string representation. In addition,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matching with grapheme cluster semantics compares characters using their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"canonical representation, corresponding with how strings comparison works.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When matching with Unicode scalar semantics, metacharacters and character","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"classes always match a single Unicode scalar value, even if that scalar","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comprises part of a grapheme cluster.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"These semantic levels can lead to different results, especially when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"working with strings that have decomposed characters. In the following","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"queRegex"},{"text":" matches any 3-character string that begins with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"q\""},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let composed = \"qué\"","let decomposed = \"que\\u{301}\"","","let queRegex = \/^q..$\/","","print(composed.contains(queRegex))","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(decomposed.contains(queRegex))","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When using Unicode scalar semantics, however, the regular expression only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"matches the composed version of the string, because each ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"."},{"text":" matches a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single Unicode scalar value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let queRegexScalar = queRegex.matchingSemantics(.unicodeScalar)","print(composed.contains(queRegexScalar))","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(decomposed.contains(queRegexScalar))","\/\/ Prints \"false\""],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"matchingSemantics(_:)","externalID":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV17matchingSemanticsyACyxGAA0C13SemanticLevelVF","symbolKind":"method","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"2.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"matchingSemantics","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegexSemanticLevel","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing18RegexSemanticLevelV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Regex","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RegexOutput","preciseIdentifier":"s:17_StringProcessing5RegexV0C6Outputa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"_StringProcessing","modules":[{"name":"Swift","relatedModules":[]}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Regex"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Regex\/matchingSemantics(_:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a regular expression that matches with the specifi